{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35703","headline":"公无渡河 · 李咸用","name":"公无渡河","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有叟有叟何清狂，行搔短髪提壶浆。\n乱流直涉神洋洋，妻止不听追沈湘。\n偕老不偕死，箜篌遗凄凉。\n刳松轻稳琅玕长，连呼急榜庸何妨。\n见溺不援能语狼，忍听丽玉传悲伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35703.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35703","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}